---
config:
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 20px
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 20
    rankSpacing: 35
    wrappingWidth: 180
    useMaxWidth: false
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Resolution can lock an outcome while settlement waits
  accDescr: Resolving outer with a pending inner Promise leaves outer pending but locked to inner. Inner fulfillment leads to outer fulfillment; inner rejection leads to outer rejection.
  P["outer: pending
resolve(inner) called"] --> L["outer: still pending
locked to inner outcome"]
  L -->|inner fulfills ready| F["outer: fulfilled ready"]
  L -->|Alternative: inner rejects| R["outer: rejected
with inner reason"]
  class L pending;
  class F success;
  class R failure;

  classDef control fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#111827;
  classDef neutral fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#4B5563,color:#111827;
  classDef success fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#15803D,color:#111827;
  classDef pending fill:#FFFBEB,stroke:#B45309,color:#111827;
  classDef failure fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#B91C1C,color:#111827;
